---
name: Local build/emulator environment quirks
description: hvigorw needs JAVA_HOME from DevEco jbr; emulator 127.0.0.1:5555 cannot resolve external DNS so online audio never plays; API via local docker :3000
type: reference
---

- hvigorw/hdc are not on PATH. Build needs `JAVA_HOME=/Applications/DevEco-Studio.app/Contents/jbr/Contents/Home` (otherwise PackageHap fails "Unable to locate a Java Runtime"), `DEVECO_SDK_HOME=/Applications/DevEco-Studio.app/Contents/sdk`, plus tools/node, tools/hvigor/bin, sdk/default/openharmony/toolchains on PATH. Unsigned HAP installs fine on the emulator.
- Emulator `127.0.0.1:5555` (API 23, 1308x2880) cannot resolve external domains (ping by IP works) → AVPlayer error 5411001, the music.126.net audio never plays, and progress stays 0:00. Observed 2026-10-18.
- The NeteaseCloudMusicApi docker container runs on host :3000. In the app, set Settings → 自定义API服务器地址 to `http://10.0.2.2:3000`; it was verified working on 2026-10-19. Don't use the host LAN IP, because it changes between networks (the old 192.168.1.97 stopped working). The setting persists across `install -r`.
- The full write-up is in the project's spec/baseline-notes.md §2 and §7.
